    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Genki Break! is a fast-paced 3D fighting game all about movement and stamina management!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genki Break! features an 8-way walk, 4-way dashes, and directional-based movesets along with a unique stamina system. <br><br>Don't feel like losing? Press all 3 buttons and spend a chunk of stamina to regain a sliver of health and get back in the fight using <strong>ADRENALINE RUSH</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid overspending stamina or risk becoming <strong>STAMINA BROKEN</strong>. A state in which any knockdown becomes fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >End in a round while <strong>STAMINA BROKEN</strong> or in <strong>ADRENALINE RUSH</strong>, you'll enter <strong>STAMINA PENALTY</strong> for the next round. <strong>STAMINA PENALTY</strong> reduces your maximum stamina.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817720/extras/aa16bf9caea84303311e2a55e8b098d3.poster.avif?t=1754945557\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817720/extras/aa16bf9caea84303311e2a55e8b098d3.webm?t=1754945557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817720/extras/aa16bf9caea84303311e2a55e8b098d3.mp4?t=1754945557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It features a cast of 4 unique fighters: Alex, Lumber, Sho, and Mike!</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alex, a boxer with evasive movement and quick strikes.     <br>    <br>Lumber, a pro-wrestler with heavy hitting attacks and even heavier throws!     <br>    <br>Sho, a martial artist equipped with a nice balance of powerful and fast strikes.     <br>    <br>Mike, a street brawler with advancing strikes and brutal offense.     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817720/extras/bfa9076f1fe02a412975582cc84d7373.avif?t=1754945557\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Modes include: Online Versus (Lobbies), Local Versus, 4-Player, Arcade, Survival, and Training.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Online Versus: Play online in lobbies with ROLLBACK NETCODE!  <br> <br>Local Versus: Duke it out side-by-side, one on one. <br> <br>4-Player: A chaotic 1v1v1v1 arena battle, last one standing wins! <br> <br>Arcade: Face all 4 fighters leading up to a climatic final boss to win the Genki Break! tournament!  <br> <br>Survival: Fight an endless onslaught on increasingly difficult fighters.  <br> <br>Training: Hone your skills, analyze the data, and lab combos! Featuring a hitbox viewer, frame data, and various other options to give you all the tools you need to practice the game! <br> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817720/extras/1317bafc8929728433f152a52e6e4483.poster.avif?t=1754945557\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817720/extras/1317bafc8929728433f152a52e6e4483.webm?t=1754945557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817720/extras/1317bafc8929728433f152a52e6e4483.mp4?t=1754945557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Genki Break! is a fast-paced 3D fighting game all about movement and stamina management!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genki Break! features an 8-way walk, 4-way dashes, and directional-based movesets along with a unique stamina system. <br><br>Don't feel like losing? Press all 3 buttons and spend a chunk of stamina to regain a sliver of health and get back in the fight using <strong>ADRENALINE RUSH</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid overspending stamina or risk becoming <strong>STAMINA BROKEN</strong>. A state in which any knockdown becomes fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >End in a round while <strong>STAMINA BROKEN</strong> or in <strong>ADRENALINE RUSH</strong>, you'll enter <strong>STAMINA PENALTY</strong> for the next round. <strong>STAMINA PENALTY</strong> reduces your maximum stamina.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817720/extras/aa16bf9caea84303311e2a55e8b098d3.poster.avif?t=1754945557\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817720/extras/aa16bf9caea84303311e2a55e8b098d3.webm?t=1754945557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817720/extras/aa16bf9caea84303311e2a55e8b098d3.mp4?t=1754945557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It features a cast of 4 unique fighters: Alex, Lumber, Sho, and Mike!</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alex, a boxer with evasive movement and quick strikes.     <br>    <br>Lumber, a pro-wrestler with heavy hitting attacks and even heavier throws!     <br>    <br>Sho, a martial artist equipped with a nice balance of powerful and fast strikes.     <br>    <br>Mike, a street brawler with advancing strikes and brutal offense.     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817720/extras/bfa9076f1fe02a412975582cc84d7373.avif?t=1754945557\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Modes include: Online Versus (Lobbies), Local Versus, 4-Player, Arcade, Survival, and Training.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Online Versus: Play online in lobbies with ROLLBACK NETCODE!  <br> <br>Local Versus: Duke it out side-by-side, one on one. <br> <br>4-Player: A chaotic 1v1v1v1 arena battle, last one standing wins! <br> <br>Arcade: Face all 4 fighters leading up to a climatic final boss to win the Genki Break! tournament!  <br> <br>Survival: Fight an endless onslaught on increasingly difficult fighters.  <br> <br>Training: Hone your skills, analyze the data, and lab combos! Featuring a hitbox viewer, frame data, and various other options to give you all the tools you need to practice the game! <br> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817720/extras/1317bafc8929728433f152a52e6e4483.poster.avif?t=1754945557\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817720/extras/1317bafc8929728433f152a52e6e4483.webm?t=1754945557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817720/extras/1317bafc8929728433f152a52e6e4483.mp4?t=1754945557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p>",
